    "preamble": "Bijoy Kumar Kamani vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 28 July, 2021 Author: S. Pujahari Bench: S. Pujahari In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No.6716 of 2021 Bijoy Kumar Kamani .... Petitioner -versus- State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Coram: Justice S. Pujahari Order Order 28.07.2021 No. 03. 1.",
